          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            If you want a gravity filter and care about lead or PFAS, buy the Culligan MaxClear Venture with two filters and budget for changing them every 100 gallons. It is the only stainless gravity system we found with a published health-effects certification. If you would rather have a small plug-in unit with the same three standards, the Aquasana Clean Water Machine is the pick.
          </p>
